OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian railway tunnel reopens
OL,4,Aafter #1.1m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 400 metre-long Victorian railway
OL,7,Ftunnel in Derbyshire has reopened after
OL,8,F#1.1m of upgrade work.
OL,10,FThe Eaves Tunnel, on the Buxton Line in
OL,11,Fthe Peak District, was closed
OL,12,Fthroughout the weekend, as well as the
OL,13,Frest of the line between New Mills
OL,14,FNewtown and Buxton.
OL,16,FRail replacement buses were in
OL,17,Foperation while new railway foundation
OL,18,Fstone, known as ballast was laid and
OL,19,Fmore than 1,200 metres of ageing track
OL,20,Fwas replaced in the 163-year-old
OL,21,Ftunnel.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
